/**
 * imageProxy — the ONE place a Monitor thumbnail becomes a client-side src.
 *
 * Extracted from WebResultCard (#1135) so the image gallery grid (#2994), the
 * image detail preview, and the existing web result card all load a thumbnail
 * through the same route. The raw provider/Google URL is ALWAYS fetched through
 * the BFF image-proxy (`/api/v1/monitor/search/image-proxy?url=<encoded>`),
 * never from the source host directly — a privacy / no-hotlink requirement, and
 * the CSP only allows the proxy origin.
